## Command

```shell
biome lint file.md
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "parser": {
      "frontmatter": true
    }
  },
  "linter": {
    "rules": {
      "nursery": {
        "noDuplicateMapKeys": "error"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## `file.md`

```md
---
title: Biome
title: Duplicate
---

# Embeds

```js
debugger;
```

```js
function () {}
```

```css
a {
  color: red;
  color: blue;
}
```

```html
<img src="code-block.png">
```

<img src="html-block.png">

<!-- biome-ignore-start lint/suspicious/noDebugger: example -->

```js
debugger;
```

